== C. numerator: ev=WRONG_REFUSAL, by rule ==
   NOT SCOPED, and this is a measured hole, not a shortcut: a WRONG_REFUSAL
   line carries no sess, no sid and no call — only rule, why, ts. So a
   numerator cannot be joined to the individual refusal it belongs to, and
   cannot be filtered to this run at all. The join happens on the RULE NAME
   only. Fixing the record shape is out of this card's scope; the gap is
   named here so no reader mistakes the join for a tight one.
