== E. what this script does NOT measure ==
   - a refusal nobody declared wrong is counted as CORRECT here. Silence is
     not evidence; native/refusal_rate.sh cannot tell a right refusal from
     an unreported wrong one.
   - WRONG_REFUSAL cannot be scoped to a run (C), so wrong/denominator mixes
     one machine's numerator with one run's denominator.
   - the hand-counted numbers published for this run ('4 events / 2 classes',
     'catch 4') are a DIFFERENT method on a DIFFERENT population. They stand
     as written and are not compared with anything above.
